      "content": "wait really? i thought vitamin K was just a natural vitamin and it wouldnt affect meds that much. my doctor didnt mention anything about supplements when he prescribed the warfarin, he just talked about diet. are you sure its that big of a deal? it's just a vitamin, it can't be that much worse than the medication itself.",
